    <briefdescription>
<para>A pass manager to run a set of extra loop passes if the MarkerTy analysis is present. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows passes to request additional transformations on demand. An example is doing additional runs of SimpleLoopUnswitch. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
